You use your bond with horrors to summon a decaying bloated horror for [3, 5, 6, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.

The decaying horror cannot move and will attack all hostile creatures in range of it. It possesses the talents Mind Disruption and Mind Sear.

All its primary stats will be set to [10, 25, 50, 75, 100 (MAG 10-100)] (based on your Magic stat), life rating increased by [1, 2, 3, 5, 6 (TL1-5)], and all talent levels set to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)].  Many other stats will scale with level.

Your increased damage, damage penetration, critical strike chance, and critical strike multiplier stats will all be inherited.
